# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in real values.

# Safe Transaction Service API key, used to load this Safe's live pending
# transactions on Sepolia (src/lib/safe-core.ts -> readSepoliaSafeQueue).
# Get a free key at https://developer.safe.global — Safe has required an API
# key for every chain's transaction service since 2024. Without this set,
# the "Needs attention" / "Signing queue" views fall back to a message
# explaining that live transactions couldn't be loaded, rather than mock data.
VITE_SAFE_API_KEY=

# "Add .env.example for Safe API key."
